                                                "sense_id": "1ae2ebf9-8b16-3263-b14b-dfd57551fbcd",
                                                "text": "On the question of rehabilitation for cancelled celebrities, the nature of the offence is relevant: a bad day is different from a life of abusive crime."
                                            }
